This JTrac is an unofficial, independent reimagining of how the original JTrac issue
tracker (JTrac 2.3.3) could look in the modern era. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
by or maintained by the original JTrac project or its authors. The behaviour of the
original was studied with the REA MCP reverse-engineering server; no source code, schema
or templates of the original are included in this product.

Release packages built from this repository bundle third-party software:
  - Eclipse Temurin (OpenJDK) 25 runtime: GPL v2 with the Classpath Exception
    (notices in runtime/legal/ inside each package)
  - PostgreSQL 18 binaries: PostgreSQL License (licenses/PostgreSQL-LICENSE.txt),
    packaged by io.zonky.test.postgres:embedded-postgres-binaries (Apache License 2.0)
  - Java and JavaScript libraries listed in licenses/THIRD-PARTY-JAVA.md and
    licenses/THIRD-PARTY-WEB.md inside each package (generated at release time)
